module Collections

### Suflae SF-realm Collections deque — roam-boundary wrapper over a bare RF::Collections.Deque[T].
### Entity + default constructor hand-written; every other method auto-forwarded (SuflaeForwarders).
entity Deque[T]
  secret inner: RF::Collections.Deque[T]

routine Deque[T]() -> Deque[T]
  return Deque[T](inner: RF::Collections.Deque[T]())
